Headroom is inspired by / based on unraid-plg-zram by John White,
used with the author's permission.
Reference project: https://github.com/johnpwhite/unraid-plg-zram

Headroom is an independently implemented plugin. The reference informed its
Unraid integration, compressed-swap lifecycle, and migration compatibility.
John White's original plugin and its contributors deserve credit for that work.
No bundled Chart.js, original application implementation, or Unraid theme
assets are redistributed as Headroom source. Unraid's native theme and fonts
are used from the installed host. MIT covers the new Headroom implementation,
not upstream projects or Unraid itself.
